  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hand in Hand</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Mainstreaming Shared Society project adds three more integrated schools to Hand in Hands growing network of Jewish-Arab bilingual schools in Israel benefiting an additional 2,500 students. The project supports local communities to establish and/or expand the constituency of Arab and Jewish families committed to building a viable, growing, and resilient shared society</narrative>
  </description>
